# The build context is the whole repo: only what the site needs goes in.
*
!website
!src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
!docs/TODO-*.md
# The page of the example plugins shows their code, checked against these files by its tests.
!plugins
plugins/*/node_modules
# The pages of the plugins show the code of the SDK's templates too (ESC-325), checked the same way.
!sdk/create-escouade-plugin/templates
sdk/create-escouade-plugin/templates/*/node_modules
sdk/create-escouade-plugin/templates/*/target
# And the two plugins their examples are quoted from (ESC-342).
!sdk/doc-examples
sdk/doc-examples/*/node_modules
sdk/doc-examples/*/target
sdk/doc-examples/*/dist
website/node_modules
website/.nuxt
website/.output
website/.data
website/dist
website/.impeccable
